      <activity id="0d8ddf1f-ea1f-5e3f-b166-d228cde4b998" activityNameId="612708f4-6f4f-5860-9549-185a2e8a521d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood-metal, natural/varnished, frame cover, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood-metal, natural/varnished, frame cover, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The average visible area is 0.29m2. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: c76fc3ea-71e3-3fc2-a5e4-02cc6ae079d3
Included are the materials used in a wooden-metal window frame with surface treatment and the panelling of the frame. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c76fc3ea-71e3-3fc2-a5e4-02cc6ae079d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
